<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Rapport de suivi pondéral</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 8mm 9mm 9mm; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { margin: 0; color: #1d2924; font-family: DejaVu Sans, sans-serif; font-size: 8.4px; line-height: 1.32; }
        h1, h2, p { margin-top: 0; }
        .header { margin-bottom: 8px; padding-bottom: 7px; border-bottom: 1px solid #a9b8b1; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0 0 3px; color: #173f33; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.1; }
        .header-meta { color: #53645d; font-size: 7.6px; }
        .header-meta span { margin-right: 13px; white-space: nowrap; }
        .kpis { width: 100%; margin-bottom: 5px; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 4px 0; table-layout: fixed; }
        .kpis td { width: 25%; height: 58px; padding: 7px 8px; border: 1px solid #dce5e1; border-radius: 5px; background: #f4f7f5; vertical-align: top; }
        .kpi-label { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #60716a; font-size: 6.9px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: .45px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .kpi-value { display: block; color: #173f33; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.05; }
        .kpi-detail { display: block; margin-top: 3px; color: #66766f; font-size: 6.8px; }
        .secondary { width: 100%; margin-bottom: 7px; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; }
        .secondary td { width: 33.333%; padding: 4px 7px; border-right: 1px solid #d9e2de; background: #fafbfa; }
        .secondary td:last-child { border-right: 0; }
        .secondary span { display: block; color: #65756e; font-size: 6.7px; }
        .secondary strong { color: #263832; font-size: 9px; }
        .section-title { margin: 0 0 4px; color: #234f41; font-size: 10px; }
        .chart-shell { margin-bottom: 5px; padding: 5px 5px 2px; border: 1px solid #d4dfda; border-radius: 6px; page-break-inside: avoid; }
        .chart-shell img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 270px; }
        .chart-caption { margin: 2px 3px 0; color: #68776f; font-size: 6.5px; }
        .summary-grid { width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 5px 0; table-layout: fixed; }
        .summary-grid > tbody > tr > td { padding: 7px 8px; border: 1px solid #dce5e1; border-radius: 5px; vertical-align: top; }
        .summary-grid h2 { margin: 0 0 4px; color: #234f41; font-size: 9px; }
        .summary-grid p { margin: 0; color: #35463f; font-size: 7.4px; white-space: pre-line; }
        .summary-grid .empty { color: #7b8983; font-style: italic; }
        .food-metrics { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        .food-metrics td { padding: 2px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #edf1ef; }
        .food-metrics td:last-child { text-align: right; font-weight: bold; }
        .notice { margin: 5px 2px 0; color: #68776f; font-size: 6.3px; }
        .footer { position: fixed; right: 0; bottom: -5mm; left: 0; padding-top: 4px; border-top: 1px solid #bcc9c3; color: #65756e; font-size: 6.2px; }
        .footer-right { float: right; }
        .negative { color: #17664f; }
        .positive { color: #9a4d32; }
        .neutral { color: #45564f; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="header">
        <h1>Rapport de suivi pondéral</h1>
        <div class="header-meta">
            <span>Généré le {{ report.generatedAt|date('d/m/Y') }}</span>
            <span>Suivi du {{ report.trackingStartDate|date('d/m/Y') }} au {{ report.trackingEndDate|date('d/m/Y') }}</span>
            <span>Âge : {{ report.age }} ans</span>
            <span>Taille : {{ report.height|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} cm</span>
        </div>
    </header>

    <table class="kpis"><tr>
        <td>
            <span class="kpi-label">Poids initial déclaré</span>
            <span class="kpi-value">{{ report.startingWeight is not null ? report.startingWeight|number_format(1, ',', ' ') ~ ' kg' : 'Non disponible' }}</span>
            <span class="kpi-detail">IMC initial : {{ report.startingBmi is not null ? report.startingBmi|number_format(1, ',', ' ') : 'Non disponible' }} · Référence du profil</span>
        </td>
        <td>
            <span class="kpi-label">Dernier poids</span>
            <span class="kpi-value">{{ report.latestWeight is not null ? report.latestWeight|number_format(1, ',', ' ') ~ ' kg' : 'Non disponible' }}</span>
            <span class="kpi-detail">
                IMC actuel : {{ report.currentBmi is not null ? report.currentBmi|number_format(1, ',', ' ') : 'Non disponible' }}
                {% if report.latestWeightDate %} · {{ report.latestWeightIsDeclared ? 'Valeur déclarée' : 'Pesée' }} du {{ report.latestWeightDate|date('d/m/Y') }}{% endif %}
            </span>
        </td>
        <td>
            <span class="kpi-label">Évolution totale</span>
            {% if report.totalChange is not null %}
                <span class="kpi-value {{ report.totalChange < 0 ? 'negative' : (report.totalChange > 0 ? 'positive' : 'neutral') }}">{{ report.totalChange > 0 ? '+' : '' }}{{ report.totalChange|number_format(1, ',', ' ') }} kg</span>
                <span class="kpi-detail">{{ report.totalChangePercentage > 0 ? '+' : '' }}{{ report.totalChangePercentage|number_format(1, ',', ' ') }} % du poids initial</span>
            {% else %}<span class="kpi-value">Non disponible</span>{% endif %}
        </td>
        <td>
            <span class="kpi-label">Rythme moyen</span>
            {% if report.averageWeeklyChange is not null %}
                <span class="kpi-value {{ report.averageWeeklyChange < 0 ? 'negative' : (report.averageWeeklyChange > 0 ? 'positive' : 'neutral') }}">{{ report.averageWeeklyChange > 0 ? '+' : '' }}{{ report.averageWeeklyChange|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }}</span>
                <span class="kpi-detail">kg/semaine, sur le temps réel écoulé</span>
            {% else %}<span class="kpi-value">Non disponible</span>{% endif %}
        </td>
    </tr></table>

    <table class="secondary"><tr>
        <td><span>Durée du suivi</span><strong>{{ report.trackingDurationDays is not null ? report.trackingDurationDays ~ ' jours' : 'Non disponible' }}</strong></td>
        <td><span>Depuis la pesée précédente</span><strong>{% if report.previousMeasurementChange is not null %}{{ report.previousMeasurementChange > 0 ? '+' : '' }}{{ report.previousMeasurementChange|number_format(1, ',', ' ') }} kg{% else %}Non disponible{% endif %}</strong></td>
        <td><span>Variation autour des 30 jours</span><strong>{% if report.thirtyDayChange is not null %}{{ report.thirtyDayChange > 0 ? '+' : '' }}{{ report.thirtyDayChange|number_format(1, ',', ' ') }} kg{% else %}Non disponible{% endif %}</strong></td>
    </tr></table>

    <h2 class="section-title">Évolution complète du poids</h2>
    <section class="chart-shell">
        <img src="{{ report.chartDataUri }}" alt="Graphique de l’évolution du poids">
        <p class="chart-caption">
            {{ report.measurementCount }} pesée{{ report.measurementCount > 1 ? 's' : '' }} de suivi.
            Le losange représente le poids initial déclaré, placé en ouverture de la série. Les tendances à 4 semaines, 8 semaines et depuis le début sont descriptives et ne constituent pas des prédictions.
        </p>
    </section>

    {% set showFood = report.foodEntryCount > 0 %}
    {% set columnCount = (report.habitSummary ? 1 : 0) + (report.medicalNotes ? 1 : 0) + (showFood ? 1 : 0) %}
    {% set columnCount = columnCount > 0 ? columnCount : 1 %}
    <table class="summary-grid"><tr>
        {% if report.habitSummary %}<td style="width: {{ 100 / columnCount }}%"><h2>Évolution des habitudes</h2><p>{{ report.habitSummary }}</p></td>{% endif %}
        {% if report.medicalNotes %}<td style="width: {{ 100 / columnCount }}%"><h2>Informations complémentaires</h2><p>{{ report.medicalNotes }}</p></td>{% endif %}
        {% if showFood %}
            <td style="width: {{ 100 / columnCount }}%">
                <h2>Indicateurs alimentaires</h2>
                <table class="food-metrics">
                    <tr><td>Prises enregistrées</td><td>{{ report.foodEntryCount }}</td></tr>
                    {% if report.averageHungerLevel is not null %}<tr><td>Faim moyenne avant repas</td><td>{{ report.averageHungerLevel|number_format(1, ',', ' ') }}/10</td></tr>{% endif %}
                    {% if report.averagePleasureLevel is not null %}<tr><td>Plaisir moyen</td><td>{{ report.averagePleasureLevel|number_format(1, ',', ' ') }}/10</td></tr>{% endif %}
                </table>
                <p class="chart-caption">Période : {{ foodPeriodStart|date('d/m/Y') }} - {{ foodPeriodEnd|date('d/m/Y') }}.</p>
            </td>
        {% endif %}
        {% if not report.habitSummary and not report.medicalNotes and not showFood %}
            <td><h2>Synthèse complémentaire</h2><p class="empty">Aucune information facultative renseignée.</p></td>
        {% endif %}
    </tr></table>

    <p class="notice">
        Variation sur 30 jours : comparaison avec la dernière mesure disponible située entre 30 et 37 jours avant la dernière pesée.
        {% if report.invalidMeasurementCount > 0 %}{{ report.invalidMeasurementCount }} mesure{{ report.invalidMeasurementCount > 1 ? 's' : '' }} invalide{{ report.invalidMeasurementCount > 1 ? 's' : '' }} exclue{{ report.invalidMeasurementCount > 1 ? 's' : '' }} du calcul et signalée{{ report.invalidMeasurementCount > 1 ? 's' : '' }} ici.{% endif %}
    </p>

    <footer class="footer">
        Document de synthèse généré à partir des données saisies par l’utilisateur. Il ne constitue ni un diagnostic ni une recommandation médicale.
        <span class="footer-right">weight.spychest.fr</span>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
